cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Skills Corpus: a reproducible multi-platform dataset of public SKILL.md Agent Skills"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, boundary-defined corpus of 55,698 unique public Agent Skills
  (SKILL.md files with YAML frontmatter containing name + description), harvested
  across GitHub, GitLab and Gitee at a fixed 2026-07-18 snapshot. Each skill carries
  platform, repository, path, stars, license, creation/update time, sibling-file
  listing, a two-axis classification (functional category + agent platform), and
  full text (redistributed only where the source repository has a clear open-source
  or Creative-Commons license). Duplicates are collapsed by SHA-256 of the SKILL.md
  content, keeping the earliest source.
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-07-18
license: CC0-1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/lawrence3699/agent-skills-corpus"
